 "text": "Hey, good to have you here. How are you? Email is a good way to do it privately. Say it' a private family event and you want it to be special. Then tell her it' a surprise and ask her to respect that you don't want share details. People usually get it when you ask nicely but firm. Then explain it' a small wedding and they could get a guest list if they really push. Most people respect that. You lead by example. Go together and show everyone a great time. That's the real point of a wedding, after all. Good plan. Weddings are supposed to be about the couple, not everyone else.",
